{"id":"b4f7486bb215a786","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-beth-function.md","title":"Beth Function","display":"df-beth-function — Beth Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-beth-function","aliases":["58-df-beth-function","58-df-zfc-card-beth-function"],"display":"df-beth-function — Beth Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinalexpp]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-beth-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-beth-function</span><span>58-df-zfc-card-beth-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-beth-function — Beth Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"949691fe1747f59d\" href=\"?note=949691fe1747f59d\" title=\"58-df-cardinalexpp\">58-df-cardinalexpp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> (ordinal endpoint, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (set function on the ordinal segment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta+1\">\\(\\theta+1\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lim}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lim}\\)</span> (limit ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BethFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BethFunction}_S\\)</span> (beth function predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beth\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BethFunction}_S(F,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(F)=\\theta+1\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta+1\\;\\exists!\\kappa\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\kappa\\rangle\\in F)\\land F(0)=\\omega\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta+1\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\alpha))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\\bigl(F(\\alpha+1)=2^{F(\\alpha)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta+1\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to F(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\lambda}F(\\alpha)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beth\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BethFunction}_S(F,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(F)=\\theta+1\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta+1\\;\\exists!\\kappa\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\kappa\\rangle\\in F)\\land F(0)=\\omega\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta+1\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\alpha))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\\bigl(F(\\alpha+1)=2^{F(\\alpha)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta+1\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to F(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\lambda}F(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A set cannot have the proper class of all ordinals as its domain. The predicate therefore describes each set-sized initial segment of the beth recursion explicitly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinalexpp","status":"resolved","id":"949691fe1747f59d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinalexpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta$ (ordinal endpoint, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lim}$ (limit ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-limitordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BethFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beth\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{BethFunction}_S(F,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(F)=\\theta+1\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta+1\\;\\exists!\\kappa\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\kappa\\rangle\\in F)\\land F(0)=\\omega\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta+1\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\alpha))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\\bigl(F(\\alpha+1)=2^{F(\\alpha)}\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta+1\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to F(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\lambda}F(\\alpha)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1460,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-beth-function.md|58-df-beth-function]]（batch12）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-def-operator.md]]\n[[58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]\n[[58-df-p-name.md]]\n[[58-df-aleph.md]]\n[[58-df-antichain.md]]\n[[58-df-baire-property.md]]\n[[58-df-beth-function.md]]\n[[58-df-bijective.md]]\n[[58-df-borel.md]]\n[[58-df-bounded.md]]\n[[58-df-branch.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinal.md]]\n[[58-df-car